  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support Refuges and Returnees in South Sudan.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">South Sudan is experiencing a large influx of refugees and returnees fleeing from Sudan due to political Instability seeking safety, stability and humanitarian assistance within its borders. Facilitating Action for Community Empowerment recognizes the urgent need to support these vulnerable populations. This concept note outlines our proposal to provide essential assistance in the areas of food security, non-food items (NFIs), and livelihood support.</narrative>
  </description>
